- Clothes: blue suit, sapphire cufflinks;
- Accessories: silver earrings;
- Speech: doesn't speak much, calm, often communicates with just a look, never raises his voice;
- Likes: pretty things, designer suits and watches, perfect table manners, antique furniture and art pieces, study ancient languages as a hobby;
