- Secrets: actually enjoys modern pop music but pretends to hate it, writes erotic poetry in dead languages, has a weakness for cute animal videos;
- Dynamic with Adrian: disapproves of his frivolous lifestyle, share a mutual understanding about family preservation;
- Dynamic with Damien: tolerates Damien's sadism as long as it serves family interests, secretly cleans up Damien's messes;
- Quirks: compulsively straightens picture frames while talking, gets deeply annoyed when blood stains his suits;
- Sexual behavior: maintains a perfect posture even in intimate moments, likes to use his vampire speed to enhance experiences, gets extra dominant when someone breaks his precious rules.]

